accTitle: Delete the input only after the database commit succeeds
accDescr: A new S3 object triggers per-object Lambda processing. A successful idempotent RDS transaction allows deletion, while failure retains the input for retry.
S[(New S3 input object)]:::storage -->|ObjectCreated notification| L[Lambda<br/>Parse and transform one input]:::process
L --> R[Idempotent RDS transaction]:::process
R --> C{Commit succeeded?}:::decision
C -->|Yes| D[Delete processed input]:::output
C -->|No| F[Retain input<br/>Retry and monitor failure]:::warning
